# Esc closes the Stock Monitor like the game's own windows: first the settings popover if it is
# open, then the window, and the pause menu does not open for those presses. Runs the game's own
# Esc handling. Puts the player's monitor settings back.
name Stock Monitor: Esc closes the settings popover, then the window, without the pause menu
monitor remember
monitor open
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettings
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettingsPanel
game-escape
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettingsPanel
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
expect-hidden PauseMenu
game-escape
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
expect-hidden PauseMenu
cleanup:
monitor restore
